### Obter configuração de alertas
GET http://localhost:5000/api/config/alertas-config
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Atualizar configuração de alertas
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/config/alertas-config
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ligado": true,
  "email": true,
  "whatsapp": false,
  "limite": 150.0
}
